  Stop/Cancel/opt-out/settings/stale/actual-host-visibility/readiness guards
  prevent pending opening; failed playback/mic preserves the written question.
  Ordinary replies/permission prompts do not arm capture. Click to finish;
  no silence detector or continuous listening. Default-on per-mount opt-out.
